- Duplicates badge and header gradient use `bg-warning-strong` /
  `from-accent-strong`/`to-accent-strong` (CSS vars in styles.css:30/42,
  theme-invariant) replacing the old `bg-amber-500` / `from-indigo-600
  to-purple-600` hue literals — no raw hue literal introduced.
- Decorative vertical-rule dividers (`<div class="h-6 w-px bg-white/20"
